{"seq":3,"slug":"fsm-design","title":"有限状态机设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/digital-logic/sequential-circuits/fsm-design","wordCount":1612,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"有限状态机设计\">有限状态机设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>有限状态机（Finite State Machine，FSM）是数字系统设计中最强大的抽象工具。它用有限个状态来描述系统行为——系统在任意时刻处于某个状态，根据当前输入决定输出和下一个状态。从 CPU 的控制单元到网络协议处理器，从交通灯控制器到 USB 接口，几乎所有需要&quot;按步骤执行&quot;的数字逻辑都可以建模为 FSM。</p>\n<p>FSM 分为两种基本类型：Moore 型（输出仅取决于当前状态）和 Mealy 型（输出取决于当前状态和当前输入）。这个区别看似理论化，实际上直接影响电路的时序特性和设计复杂度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph FSM 通用结构&#10;        INPUT[输入] --&gt; COMB[组合逻辑]&#10;        STATE[状态寄存器] --&gt; COMB&#10;        COMB --&gt; NS[下一状态]&#10;        COMB --&gt; OUTPUT[输出]&#10;        NS --&gt; |时钟沿| STATE&#10;    end&#10;    CLK[时钟] --&gt; STATE\">graph LR\n    subgraph FSM 通用结构\n        INPUT[输入] --&gt; COMB[组合逻辑]\n        STATE[状态寄存器] --&gt; COMB\n        COMB --&gt; NS[下一状态]\n        COMB --&gt; OUTPUT[输出]\n        NS --&gt; |时钟沿| STATE\n    end\n    CLK[时钟] --&gt; STATE</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Moore 型</th>\n<th>Mealy 型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出依赖</td>\n<td>仅当前状态</td>\n<td>当前状态 + 当前输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出变化时机</td>\n<td>状态转移后一个周期</td>\n<td>输入变化即可改变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应速度</td>\n<td>慢一个周期</td>\n<td>快（组合逻辑直通）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态数量</td>\n<td>通常更多</td>\n<td>通常更少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出毛刺</td>\n<td>无（寄存输出）</td>\n<td>可能有（组合输出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>安全性高、时序严格</td>\n<td>响应快、状态紧凑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"状态转移图与状态表\">状态转移图与状态表</h2><p>FSM 的设计从<strong>状态转移图</strong>开始。状态用圆圈表示，转移用带标签的箭头表示。标签格式因类型而异：Moore 型在状态圆圈内标注输出，Mealy 型在转移箭头上标注输入/输出。</p>\n<p>以简单的序列检测器为例——检测输入序列&quot;101&quot;：</p>\n<p>状态定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>S0：初始/等待状态</li>\n<li>S1：已检测到&quot;1&quot;</li>\n<li>S2：已检测到&quot;10&quot;</li>\n<li>S3：已检测到&quot;101&quot;（输出检测信号）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; S0&#10;    S0 --&gt; S0: 0&#10;    S0 --&gt; S1: 1&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2: 0&#10;    S1 --&gt; S1: 1&#10;    S2 --&gt; S0: 0&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3: 1&#10;    S3 --&gt; S2: 0&#10;    S3 --&gt; S1: 1\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; S0\n    S0 --&gt; S0: 0\n    S0 --&gt; S1: 1\n    S1 --&gt; S2: 0\n    S1 --&gt; S1: 1\n    S2 --&gt; S0: 0\n    S2 --&gt; S3: 1\n    S3 --&gt; S2: 0\n    S3 --&gt; S1: 1</pre><p>将状态转移图转换为<strong>状态表</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>当前状态</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>下一状态</th>\n<th>输出（Moore）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>S0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 S3 在检测到&quot;101&quot;后并不回到 S0——它继续检测下一个可能的重叠序列。例如输入&quot;10101&quot;会在第 3 位和第 5 位都产生检测信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态编码策略\">状态编码策略</h2><p>状态编码（State Encoding）是将抽象状态映射为二进制编码的过程。不同的编码策略对电路面积、速度和可靠性有显著影响。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码策略</th>\n<th>n 个状态需要的触发器数</th>\n<th>组合逻辑复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二进制编码</td>\n<td>⌈log₂n⌉</td>\n<td>较复杂</td>\n<td>状态多、触发器昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独热编码（One-Hot）</td>\n<td>n</td>\n<td>较简单</td>\n<td>FPGA（LUT 丰富）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格雷码编码</td>\n<td>⌈log₂n⌉</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>减少翻转功耗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>二进制编码</strong>用最少的触发器表示所有状态。例如 4 个状态：S0=00, S1=01, S2=10, S3=11。触发器少但状态转移的组合逻辑较复杂。</p>\n<p><strong>独热编码</strong>为每个状态分配一个触发器——同一时刻恰好只有一个触发器为 1。例如 4 个状态：S0=0001, S1=0010, S2=0100, S3=1000。虽然触发器多，但状态判断极其简单——只需检查对应位是否为 1，组合逻辑大幅简化。</p>\n<p>在 FPGA 中，独热编码通常是最优选择。因为 FPGA 的触发器（FF）相对廉价（每个 LUT 旁边都有一个 FF），而 LUT 数量有限。独热编码用更多 FF 换取更少 LUT，正好匹配 FPGA 的资源特点。</p>\n<p>对于 ASIC 设计，二进制编码通常更优，因为触发器面积是真实成本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type StateEncoding = &#39;binary&#39; | &#39;oneHot&#39; | &#39;gray&#39;;&#10;&#10;function encodeStates(numStates: number, encoding: StateEncoding): string[] {&#10;  switch (encoding) {&#10;    case &#39;binary&#39;:&#10;      return Array.from({ length: numStates }, (_, i) =&gt; i.toString(2).padStart(Math.ceil(Math.log2(numStates)), &#39;0&#39;));&#10;    case &#39;oneHot&#39;:&#10;      return Array.from({ length: numStates }, (_, i) =&gt; &#39;0&#39;.repeat(i) + &#39;1&#39; + &#39;0&#39;.repeat(numStates - i - 1));&#10;    case &#39;gray&#39;:&#10;      return Array.from({ length: numStates }, (_, i) =&gt;&#10;        (i ^ (i &gt;&gt; 1)).toString(2).padStart(Math.ceil(Math.log2(numStates)), &#39;0&#39;),&#10;      );&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StateEncoding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'binary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'oneHot'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gray'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encodeStates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">numStates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">encoding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StateEncoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (encoding) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'binary'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: numStates }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">padStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(numStates)), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'oneHot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: numStates }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(numStates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gray'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: numStates }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">padStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(numStates)), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"fsm-的硬件实现流程\">FSM 的硬件实现流程</h2><p>从状态表到物理电路的实现流程是固定的：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>状态最小化</strong>：合并等价状态（输出相同且后继状态相同）</li>\n<li><strong>状态编码</strong>：选择编码策略并分配二进制编码</li>\n<li><strong>推导转移方程</strong>：用布尔代数表示每个触发器的下一状态逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>推导输出方程</strong>：用布尔代数表示每个输出信号</li>\n<li><strong>化简实现</strong>：用卡诺图或 EDA 工具化简方程</li>\n<li><strong>画电路图</strong>：连接触发器和组合逻辑</li>\n</ol>\n<p>以序列检测器（二进制编码 S0=00,S1=01,S2=10,S3=11）为例，设状态变量为 Q₁Q₀，输入为 X：</p>\n<p>下一状态方程（化简后）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Q₁⁺ = Q₀·X&#39;（当前状态 Q₀=1 且输入为 0 时，Q₁ 置位）</li>\n<li>Q₀⁺ = X（输入为 1 时 Q₀ 置位）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>输出方程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Y = Q₁·Q₀（两个状态位都为 1 时输出有效）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph FSM 实现流程&#10;        A[状态转移图] --&gt; B[状态表]&#10;        B --&gt; C[状态最小化]&#10;        C --&gt; D[状态编码]&#10;        D --&gt; E[推导转移方程]&#10;        E --&gt; F[化简布尔表达式]&#10;        F --&gt; G[门电路实现]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph FSM 实现流程\n        A[状态转移图] --&gt; B[状态表]\n        B --&gt; C[状态最小化]\n        C --&gt; D[状态编码]\n        D --&gt; E[推导转移方程]\n        E --&gt; F[化简布尔表达式]\n        F --&gt; G[门电路实现]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"fsm-在控制单元中的应用\">FSM 在控制单元中的应用</h2><p>CPU 的控制单元是 FSM 最重要的应用。单周期处理器的控制单元是一个纯组合电路（可视为只有一个状态的 Mealy 型 FSM），而多周期处理器的控制单元则是一个具有多个状态的 Moore 型 FSM——每个状态对应指令执行的一个阶段（取指、译码、执行、访存、写回）。</p>\n<p>典型的多周期 MIPS/RISC-V 控制 FSM：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>关键控制信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FETCH</td>\n<td>取指</td>\n<td>MemRead=1, IRWrite=1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DECODE</td>\n<td>译码</td>\n<td>RegRead, ImmGen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXECUTE</td>\n<td>执行</td>\n<td>ALUSrc, ALUOp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MEMORY</td>\n<td>访存</td>\n<td>MemRead/MemWrite</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WRITEBACK</td>\n<td>写回</td>\n<td>RegWrite=1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每条指令类型（R 型、I 型、分支、访存）走过的状态路径不同。R 型指令不经过 MEMORY 状态，分支指令不经过 WRITEBACK 状态。这些不同的路径在状态转移图中表示为不同的分支。</p>\n<p>流水线处理器虽然不使用传统 FSM 控制（因为每个阶段在每个周期都同时活跃），但流水线中的冒险检测、前递控制等逻辑仍然是 FSM 的变体。</p>\n<p>FSM 的思想对软件设计也有深远影响。状态模式、正则表达式引擎、网络协议栈都是 FSM 概念在软件中的直接应用。理解 FSM 的硬件根源有助于更深刻地运用这些模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type State = &#39;IDLE&#39; | &#39;HEADER&#39; | &#39;PAYLOAD&#39; | &#39;CHECKSUM&#39; | &#39;ERROR&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface FsmTransition {&#10;  readonly from: State;&#10;  readonly input: string;&#10;  readonly to: State;&#10;  readonly action: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const packetParserFsm: FsmTransition[] = [&#10;  { from: &#39;IDLE&#39;, input: &#39;SYNC_BYTE&#39;, to: &#39;HEADER&#39;, action: &#39;resetBuffer&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;HEADER&#39;, input: &#39;VALID_HEADER&#39;, to: &#39;PAYLOAD&#39;, action: &#39;parseLength&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;HEADER&#39;, input: &#39;INVALID&#39;, to: &#39;ERROR&#39;, action: &#39;logError&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;PAYLOAD&#39;, input: &#39;DATA&#39;, to: &#39;PAYLOAD&#39;, action: &#39;appendData&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;PAYLOAD&#39;, input: &#39;COMPLETE&#39;, to: &#39;CHECKSUM&#39;, action: &#39;verify&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;CHECKSUM&#39;, input: &#39;PASS&#39;, to: &#39;IDLE&#39;, action: &#39;deliverPacket&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;CHECKSUM&#39;, input: &#39;FAIL&#39;, to: &#39;ERROR&#39;, action: &#39;requestRetransmit&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;ERROR&#39;, input: &#39;RESET&#39;, to: &#39;IDLE&#39;, action: &#39;clearState&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> State</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'IDLE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'HEADER'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PAYLOAD'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CHECKSUM'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ERROR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FsmTransition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> packetParserFsm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FsmTransition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IDLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SYNC_BYTE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HEADER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resetBuffer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HEADER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VALID_HEADER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAYLOAD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'parseLength'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HEADER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INVALID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ERROR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'logError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAYLOAD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DATA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAYLOAD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'appendData'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAYLOAD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COMPLETE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CHECKSUM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'verify'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CHECKSUM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PASS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IDLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'deliverPacket'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CHECKSUM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAIL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ERROR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'requestRetransmit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { from: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ERROR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, to: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IDLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clearState'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((有限状态机))&#10;    基本类型&#10;      Moore 型&#10;      Mealy 型&#10;      混合型&#10;    设计流程&#10;      状态转移图&#10;      状态表&#10;      状态编码&#10;      转移方程&#10;    编码策略&#10;      二进制编码&#10;      独热编码&#10;      格雷码编码&#10;    应用&#10;      序列检测器&#10;      CPU 控制单元&#10;      协议处理器\">mindmap\n  root((有限状态机))\n    基本类型\n      Moore 型\n      Mealy 型\n      混合型\n    设计流程\n      状态转移图\n      状态表\n      状态编码\n      转移方程\n    编码策略\n      二进制编码\n      独热编码\n      格雷码编码\n    应用\n      序列检测器\n      CPU 控制单元\n      协议处理器</pre><ul>\n<li>Moore 型输出仅取决于状态（无毛刺），Mealy 型还取决于输入（响应快）</li>\n<li>状态设计从状态转移图开始，经状态表、编码、方程推导最终映射为电路</li>\n<li>独热编码适合 FPGA（FF 廉价），二进制编码适合 ASIC（面积敏感）</li>\n<li>CPU 控制单元是 FSM 最经典的应用——多周期处理器的每个状态对应一个执行阶段</li>\n<li>FSM 概念延伸到软件领域的状态模式、正则表达式和协议栈</li>\n<li>状态最小化通过合并等价状态减少电路复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有限状态机设计","id":"有限状态机设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"状态转移图与状态表","id":"状态转移图与状态表"},{"level":2,"text":"状态编码策略","id":"状态编码策略"},{"level":2,"text":"FSM 的硬件实现流程","id":"fsm-的硬件实现流程"},{"level":2,"text":"FSM 在控制单元中的应用","id":"fsm-在控制单元中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"寄存器与计数器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/digital-logic/sequential-circuits/registers-counters"},"next":{"title":"存储器类型与层次","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/digital-logic/memory-systems/memory-types"}}